{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["Place now your hand under my thigh — and so too with Yosef when he swore to Yaakov. The ratification of a covenant and oath of a son or servant to his master was done thus, for the matter of servitude is similar. And so it is written: בן יכבד אב ועבד אדניו. But striking palm to palm, or ratifying a covenant between two, and passing between the pieces, is customary among other people."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:44:51.730213729Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}